SQLer: third-party licences
===========================

This file lists the third-party Rust crates that are compiled into the SQLer release binary and the licences they
are under. It is generated by .github/scripts/third-party-licenses.sh (cargo-about, about.toml, about.hbs) from
Cargo.lock for the release feature set and the union of the release targets. Do not edit it.

